{
  "title": "Quick Seared Chinese King Prawns Char Siu",
  "description": "A keto-friendly, grassy, and chewy date-night Chinese dish featuring raw king prawns, cure, and Char Siu form, served on a hot stone plate.",
  "cuisine": "Chinese",
